msgctxt "FA_001"
msgid "我醒在一间陌生的单人房。走廊那头的厅里有人在说话。"
msgstr "I woke in an unfamiliar single room. Voices came from the hall down the corridor."

msgctxt "FA_200"
msgid "我只记得登船。之后的事，我想不起来。醒来就在那间房里。"
msgstr "I only remember boarding the ship. I cannot remember what happened afterward. I woke in that room."

msgctxt "FA_201"
msgid "我只记得上了那艘船。协议是谁和我签的，我为什么来……都想不起来。"
msgstr "I only remember boarding that ship. Who signed the agreement with me, why I came... I cannot remember any of it."

msgctxt "FA_202"
msgid "门是老式滑轮配重机构。我今晨第一次到门前，生活翼这侧的铁销已插；拔销也推不动，试完我又插回去了。"
msgstr "The door uses an old pulley and counterweight mechanism. When I first reached it this morning, the iron pin on the residential-wing side was already in. I pulled it out, but still couldn't push the door open. After trying, I put it back."

msgctxt "FA_203"
msgid "外闩是不是第五个人落的？门里这些，也是他做的？"
msgstr "Did a fifth person drop the outer bar? All this inside, too?"

msgctxt "FA_240"
msgid "陌生声音，我会先辨来处和节奏；开缝听清就够，不必跨过去。昨夜是否如此，要看物证。"
msgstr "With an unfamiliar sound, I first identify its source and rhythm. A gap wide enough to hear through is enough; I needn't cross it. Whether I did that last night depends on the evidence."

msgctxt "FA_241"
msgid "落灰我会清开地方擦净，再冲洗布。这是做活习惯，不能当昨夜口供。"
msgstr "When ash falls, I clear space and wipe it up, then rinse the cloth. That's a work habit, not testimony about last night."

msgctxt "FA_242"
msgid "遇险我先查锁止，但何时锁、何时放，得按这里的规程。"
msgstr "In danger, I first check the lock. But when to secure it and when to release it depends on the rules here."

msgctxt "FA_243"
msgid "灰气来路不明，我会先关入口、隔开沾灰物；这些反应昨夜是否发生，仍由物证判断。"
msgstr "When ash-laden smoke comes from an unknown source, I close the entrance and isolate anything coated in ash. The evidence must show whether I did so last night."

msgctxt "FA_244"
msgid "右页只放事件，不必替我们写动作。按刚才的习惯推演，再从头重演、核对现场或同伴记录；记忆未恢复，不能凭猜测补空白。回应同伴也要出示证物。"
msgstr "Only put events on the right page; you needn't write our actions for us. Work from the habits we just described, then reenact from the start and compare with the scene or our companions' records. Our memories haven't returned; guesses can't fill the gaps. Show the evidence when answering a companion, too."

msgctxt "FA_204"
msgid "四道窄跟鞋印从门槛通往四间房，越走越淡，压在擦地水纹上，鞋跟比我们的制式鞋窄。第五者是在擦地后从主楼进来的。"
msgstr "Four trails of narrow-heeled prints run from the threshold to the four rooms, fading as they go and lying over the water marks from wiping. The heels are narrower than those of our issued shoes. The fifth person came from the main building after the floor was wiped."

msgctxt "FA_205"
msgid "你若从自己房里搬东西，足迹该先到门边，再回你那间；这四道却从门槛分去四间房，不能算你头上。"
msgstr "If you moved things from your own room, your prints should first lead to the door, then back to your room. These four trails branch from the threshold to all four rooms. We can't pin them on you."

msgctxt "FA_206"
msgid "先是我们应对警铃：撑缝、进灰、合门、包楔、擦地；后来才有人进出四间房、带走行李，不能把前一段也说成伪造。"
msgstr "First came our response to the bell: holding a gap, ash entering, closing the door, wrapping the wedge, and wiping the floor. Only later did someone visit the four rooms and take the luggage. We can't call the earlier stage a fabrication too."

msgctxt "FA_207"
msgid "“皆封存于主楼之内”……这话没错。外面那位进来过，身份先空着。"
msgstr "'All kept sealed within the main building'... That was true. The one outside did come in. Leave their identity open for now."

msgctxt "FA_215"
msgid "今早谁最先经过门厅？你到时内销是什么状态？"
msgstr "Who passed through the vestibule first this morning? What state was the inner pin in when you arrived?"

msgctxt "FA_216"
msgid "离开"
msgstr "Leave"

msgctxt "FA_217"
msgid "工程师到门前时，内销就已经插上了。你今早在他之前去过门厅吗？当时销子插着，还是拔着？"
msgstr "The pin was already in when the engineer arrived. Did you visit the vestibule before him this morning? Was it in or out then?"

msgctxt "FA_218"
msgid "我最先起的，出来看了一眼。销子没插，我顺手就插上了。怎么，这也算？"
msgstr "I was up first and went out to look. The pin was out, so I put it in without thinking. What, that counts too?"

msgctxt "FA_219"
msgid "算。夜里从主楼进来的那个人，离开时插不了内侧的销。你看见它拔着，正好把它离开以后到今晨的这一步补上了。"
msgstr "It does. The person who entered from the main building last night could not insert it from outside after leaving. Your seeing it out fills in what happened between their departure and this morning."

msgctxt "FA_220"
msgid "我以为你们问的是门为什么打不开，就没提这点小事。今早插销的是我，试门的是工程师，别搅在一起。"
msgstr "I thought you were asking why the door wouldn't open, so I never mentioned that little thing. I inserted it this morning; the engineer tested the door. Don't mix those up."

msgctxt "FA_221"
msgid "纸上的记号是不是你记下的铃声？“门开一掌，听”是什么意思？"
msgstr "Are those marks your record of the bell? What does 'door open one palm, listen' mean?"

msgctxt "FA_222"
msgid "离开"
msgstr "Leave"

msgctxt "FA_223"
msgid "三短一长，是铃声的节奏。这段低音记的是铃声后面的异响，不是曲子。记法是我的，昨夜的动作我还是想不起来。"
msgstr "Three short, one long: that is the bell's rhythm. The low notes record the strange sound behind the bell, not a tune. It is my notation, though I still cannot remember what I did last night."

msgctxt "FA_224"
msgid "包纸和第三页的撕口对得上。铜牌只许门开一掌；这句“听”能说明撑缝的目的，也能说明你为何在门边记它。"
msgstr "The wrapping matches the tear in page three. The plaque permits only a palm-wide opening. 'Listen' explains why the gap was held open and why you recorded this by the door."

msgctxt "FA_225"
msgid "这页记录支持辨听，不支持有人从窄缝逃走。别把纸上的实据和失去的记忆混成一件事。"
msgstr "This record supports listening, not an escape through the narrow gap. Keep what the paper proves separate from the memory we have lost."

msgctxt "FA_208"
msgid "来者确曾进出，却不可据此将诸位应对警铃的形迹一并归作伪造。请分清擦地之前与之后，说明来者从何处入内、去过何处，又如何离去。"
msgstr "The visitor did indeed enter and leave. Yet that does not make all traces of your response to the bell a fabrication. Distinguish what happened before and after the wiping: where the visitor entered, where they went, and how they departed."

msgctxt "FA_209"
msgid "尚有形迹未能照映。请核对主楼侧地面，以及门厅擦痕之上，再行辩答。"
msgstr "Some traces remain unaccounted for. Examine the floor on the main-building side and the marks over the wiped floor in the vestibule, then present your case again."

msgctxt "FA_226"
msgid "尚有形迹未能照映。诸位所述只照见警铃期间之事。请回门厅，放低油灯查验擦痕之上，再从检视盖向下核对主楼侧地面。"
msgstr "Some traces remain unaccounted for. Your account explains only the time during the bell. Return to the vestibule, lower the oil lamp to examine what lies over the wiping marks, and look down through the inspection hatch at the main-building floor."

msgctxt "FA_227"
msgid "那边的地，我只看了横闩，没往下看。得再去一趟。"
msgstr "I only looked at the bar over there, not down at the floor. We need another visit."

msgctxt "FA_210"
msgid "昨夜警铃响，音乐家依规程一用楔撑开一掌窄缝辨听主楼；包纸记谱与门底磨痕相合。黑灰涌入，我撤楔让配重合门，再依规程二用第三页包楔，投进自己的纸篓。"
msgstr "When the bell rang last night, the musician followed Rule One, wedging a palm-wide gap to listen toward the main building. The notation on the wrapping matches the marks beneath the door. Black ash surged in; I removed the wedge so the counterweight shut the door. Then, under Rule Two, I wrapped the wedge in page three and put it in my own wastebasket."

msgctxt "FA_211"
msgid "主厨擦去门厅落灰，在水盆洗布晾开；工程师遇险插销。铃停后依规程三拔销，留入口给院方巡查。"
msgstr "The chef wiped the fallen ash from the vestibule, washed the cloth in the basin, and spread it to dry. The engineer inserted the pin in response to the danger. Once the bell stopped, the pin was removed under Rule Three to let academy staff enter for inspection."

msgctxt "FA_212"
msgid "此后院方来者全开重门：主楼灰上的整扇扫弧证明开门晚于进灰；擦痕上的四道窄跟鞋印，证明来者从门槛进四间房收走行李，再回主楼。配重合门后，院方依规程四落外闩。"
msgstr "Afterward, an academy visitor opened the heavy door fully. The full sweep through the ash on the main-building side proves the door opened after the ash entered. Four narrow-heeled trails over the wiping marks show the visitor went from the threshold into the four rooms, took the luggage, then returned to the main building. The counterweight shut the door; the academy lowered the outer bar under Rule Four."

msgctxt "FA_213"
msgid "来者在外插不了内销。今晨主厨最先见销拔着，顺手插上；工程师随后见销已插，拔销试门，受外闩阻挡后插回。夜里插、铃停拔、今晨再插，是三步。"
msgstr "The visitor couldn't insert the inner pin from outside. This morning the chef was first to see the pin out and put it in without thinking. The engineer arrived later, found it in, pulled it out to test the door, then put it back when the outer bar blocked it. Inserting it at night, removing it when the bell stopped, and inserting it again this morning were three steps."

msgctxt "FA_214"
msgid "……善。警铃应对、铃止巡查、今晨重插内销，皆已说明。夜里与今晨插销者不同，外闩亦属院方。"
msgstr "...Good. The response to the bell, the inspection after it stopped, and this morning's reinsertion of the inner pin are all explained. Different people inserted it at night and this morning; the academy also operated the outer bar."

msgctxt "FA_107"
msgid "铁销插在内侧的销座里。"
msgstr "The iron bolt is seated in its bracket on this side."

msgctxt "FA_108"
msgid "内侧铁销已经拔出。"
msgstr "The inner bolt has been withdrawn."

msgctxt "FA_109"
msgid "拔出内销"
msgstr "Withdraw the inner bolt"

msgctxt "FA_110"
msgid "铁销从销座里滑出来了。"
msgstr "The bolt slides out of its bracket."

msgctxt "FA_111"
msgid "插回内销"
msgstr "Slide the inner bolt back"

msgctxt "FA_112"
msgid "铁销重新插入销座。"
msgstr "The bolt slides back into its bracket."

msgctxt "FA_113"
msgid "推门"
msgstr "Push the door"

msgctxt "FA_114"
msgid "门扇一动，内侧铁销便抵住了销座。"
msgstr "The door barely moves before the inner bolt catches against its bracket."

msgctxt "FA_115"
msgid "内销虽已拔出，门仍被外面的横闩挡住。"
msgstr "The inner bolt is out, but the bar outside still blocks the door."

msgctxt "FA_116"
msgid "内销已经拔了，门还是推不开。阻力在另一侧，得看看。"
msgstr "The inner bolt is out, but the door still won't open. Something is resisting on the other side. I should look."

msgctxt "FA_117"
msgid "拉门"
msgstr "Pull the door"

msgctxt "FA_118"
msgid "门扇抵在石止口上，向这边拉不开。"
msgstr "The door rests against the stone stop. It won't open toward me."

msgctxt "FA_119"
msgid "掀开检视盖"
msgstr "Lift the inspection cover"

msgctxt "FA_120"
msgid "窄孔外，一根横闩落在门另一侧的两只卡座里。从这里够不到。"
msgstr "Through the narrow opening, I can see a bar resting in two brackets on the far side. I can't reach it from here."

msgctxt "FA_228"
msgid "从检视盖向下看主楼侧地面"
msgstr "Look down through the inspection hatch at the main-building floor"

msgctxt "FA_229"
msgid "主楼侧的积灰被门底扫出了一道完整的扇形弧，弧宽覆盖整扇门。这不是一掌宽窄缝留下的印子：灰落下之后，门完全打开过。"
msgstr "The door's lower edge swept a complete fan-shaped arc through the ash on the main-building side, covering the full width of the door. A palm-wide gap could not make this mark: the door opened fully after the ash fell."

msgctxt "FA_230"
msgid "夜里插上的内销必定拔出过，否则这扇门无法开到这里。警铃停后该怎样处置，铜牌第三条写着。"
msgstr "The pin inserted last night must have been removed, or the door could not have opened this far. The plaque's third rule says what should happen after the bell stops."

msgctxt "FA_121"
msgid "检查铰链与配重"
msgstr "Inspect the hinges and counterweight"

msgctxt "FA_122"
msgid "铰链允许门向另一侧转动。绳子经过滑轮，连着悬垂的重块，拉力指向合门方向。"
msgstr "The hinges let the door swing to the other side. A rope runs over a pulley to a hanging weight, pulling the door shut."

msgctxt "FA_123"
msgid "离开门边"
msgstr "Step away from the door"

msgctxt "FA_231"
msgid "警铃下方固定着一块铜牌，标题是“生活翼警铃规程”。这是门厅的设施配件，四条规程都刻在上面。"
msgstr "A fixed brass plaque below the alarm bell is titled 'Residential Wing Alarm Regulations.' It is a fixture of the vestibule, with four rules engraved on it."

msgctxt "FA_232"
msgid "一、警铃鸣响期间，重门开启不得逾一掌之宽；须辨听主楼动静者，以楔保持窄缝，不得跨越。"
msgstr "One: While the alarm sounds, the heavy door must open no wider than one palm. Those listening for activity in the main building shall hold a narrow gap with a wedge and shall not cross it."

msgctxt "FA_233"
msgid "二、沾染炉灰之物，以纸包裹，投入本人居室纸篓，勿经他人之手。"
msgstr "Two: Wrap objects soiled with furnace ash in paper and dispose of them in the wastebasket in your own room. Do not pass them through another person's hands."

msgctxt "FA_234"
msgid "三、警铃止息后，须拔出内销，以便院方人员入内巡查。"
msgstr "Three: Once the alarm ceases, remove the inner pin so academy personnel may enter for inspection."

msgctxt "FA_235"
msgid "四、外闩由院方落放与升起，学员不得操作。"
msgstr "Four: The outer bar shall be lowered and raised by the academy. Students shall not operate it."

msgctxt "FA_236"
msgid "把油灯放低，让光贴着地面扫过去，再用放大镜看。湿擦留下的水纹上，压着四道窄跟鞋灰印。"
msgstr "Lower the oil lamp so its light grazes the floor, then look through the magnifying glass. Four trails of narrow-heeled ash prints lie over the water marks left by wiping."

msgctxt "FA_237"
msgid "鞋印处的水纹断开，灰印却没有被抹散。先擦地，后有人踩过；不能把顺序倒过来。"
msgstr "The water marks break at the footprints, but the ash has not been smeared. The floor was wiped first, then someone walked here. The order cannot be reversed."

msgctxt "FA_238"
msgid "四道印子都从重门门槛起，分别通往四扇房门，越往房门越淡。这双鞋的后跟比我们四人的制式鞋窄。"
msgstr "All four trails start at the heavy door's threshold and lead to the four room doors, growing fainter toward the rooms. The heels are narrower than those of the issued shoes all four of us wear."

msgctxt "FA_239"
msgid "有人从主楼把灰带进了已经擦净的门厅，随后去过四间房。它的动作在我们应对警铃之后。"
msgstr "Someone brought ash from the main building into the cleaned vestibule, then visited all four rooms. Their actions followed our response to the bell."

msgctxt "FA_NAME_INTRO"
msgid "{{player_name}}，好。我是沈鼎，掌勺的。这位大个子是霍铎，那位是苏泠。你也是签了协议，坐船来的？"
msgstr "{{player_name}}, good. I'm Shen Ding, I run a kitchen. The big fellow is Huo Duo, and that's Su Ling. You signed an agreement and came by ship too?"

msgctxt "FA_NAME_PAIR"
msgid "我没意见。两个人一组，效率最高。{{player_name}}，你想先跟谁去哪间？"
msgstr "I have no objection. Two-person teams are most efficient. {{player_name}}, who would you like to go with first, and where?"

msgctxt "FA_002"
msgid "枕边的外衣合身，桌上的用具顺手……这处居所处处留着我的生活习惯，但我却想不起自己在这里住过多久。"
msgstr "The coat by the pillow fits, and the things on the desk feel familiar... This place is full of my habits, yet I can't remember how long I've lived here."

msgctxt "FA_003"
msgid "你也醒了？过来时留神脚下，这里有些金属碎屑。"
msgstr "You're awake too? Watch your step. There are metal shavings here."

msgctxt "FA_004"
msgid "谢谢。你知道这是哪里吗？"
msgstr "Thanks. Do you know where we are?"

msgctxt "FA_005"
msgid "没有。我刚检查了这几间宿舍，走廊南端有一扇极沉的铁门，推不开。我是做机械工程的，手上的活还顺手，但记不起昨晚的事情。"
msgstr "No. I've checked these dorm rooms. There's an extremely heavy iron door at the south end of the corridor that won't budge. I'm a mechanical engineer; my hands still know their work, but I can't remember last night."

msgctxt "FA_006"
msgid "侦探？那你瞧瞧这窗上的铁条、门上的编号，还有那扇封死的重门。凭构造看，这里很像某种收容或拘禁设施。"
msgstr "A detective? Then look at the bars on the windows, the numbers on the doors, and that sealed heavy door. Judging by the construction, this looks like some kind of detention facility or prison."

msgctxt "FA_007"
msgid "我是侦探。我也记不得之前的经历。"
msgstr "I'm a detective. I can't remember anything that came before, either."

msgctxt "FA_008"
msgid "我也是。手上的活还记得怎么做，昨晚的事却一点也想不起来。"
msgstr "Same here. I remember how to do my work, but nothing about last night."

msgctxt "FA_009"
msgid "收容？仅凭门窗的坚固程度，还不能定性用途。"
msgstr "A detention facility? Sturdy doors and windows alone aren't enough to determine what this place is for."

msgctxt "FA_010"
msgid "我听见备餐间有人走动，还没来得及过去。"
msgstr "I heard someone moving in the pantry. I haven't been over yet."

msgctxt "FA_011"
msgid "或许吧。备餐间有水声，南边门前还有个人。如果找到能拆卸门窗的工具，叫我一声，我再仔细看看这扇门。"
msgstr "Maybe. I hear water in the pantry, and there's someone by the south door. If you find tools that could take the door or windows apart, let me know and I'll inspect that door more closely."

msgctxt "FA_012"
msgid "碎片先收好，别伤到人。"
msgstr "Put the fragments away first. Someone could get hurt."

msgctxt "FA_013"
msgid "房门本身能推开，没有外部反锁。真正卡死通路的是南端那道重型铁门。"
msgstr "The bedroom doors open; they aren't locked from outside. The heavy iron door at the south end is what really blocks the way."

msgctxt "FA_014"
msgid "别喝生水，水箱我还没查完。"
msgstr "Don't drink the water untreated. I haven't finished checking the tank."

msgctxt "FA_015"
msgid "水质有问题？"
msgstr "Is something wrong with the water?"

msgctxt "FA_016"
msgid "水看起来没问题，但储粮柜不太寻常。柜子里只有四份切好的干面包，按人头分装，油纸上贴着“丙型配给”。除此之外，连多余的生面粉都没有。"
msgstr "The water seems fine, but the food cupboard is odd. There are only four portions of sliced hard bread, one for each person, wrapped in waxed paper labeled ‘Type C Ration.’ There's not even any extra flour."

msgctxt "FA_017"
msgid "只有一天的分量？"
msgstr "Only enough for one day?"

msgctxt "FA_018"
msgid "我是个厨师，习惯先清点食水。这里的存粮只够我们维持今天的基础消耗，不像是长住的库房。"
msgstr "I'm a chef, so I always start by counting the food and water. The stores here will cover only our basic needs today; this doesn't look like a long-term supply room."

msgctxt "FA_019"
msgid "看来留给我们的时间并不充裕。"
msgstr "It seems we don't have much time."

msgctxt "FA_020"
msgid "我是侦探，也在找出去的路。"
msgstr "I'm a detective. I'm looking for a way out too."

msgctxt "FA_021"
msgid "好。你去查出路，我来分好今日的口粮。找到别人，让他们到起居室汇合。"
msgstr "All right. You look for a way out while I divide today's rations. If you find the others, ask them to meet in the common room."

msgctxt "FA_022"
msgid "明白，你留神安全。"
msgstr "Understood. Stay safe."

msgctxt "FA_023"
msgid "口粮已经切好分装了。天黑前如果找不出出路，我们没有多余的储备过夜。"
msgstr "The rations are already divided. If we can't find a way out before dark, there's nothing extra to get us through the night."

msgctxt "FA_024"
msgid "请稍等片刻……让空气静下来，我在听门外的风声。"
msgstr "Wait a moment... Let the air settle. I'm listening to the wind beyond the door."

msgctxt "FA_025"
msgid "好。听到了什么？"
msgstr "Of course. What can you hear?"

msgctxt "FA_026"
msgid "门缝里有低微的气流声，像隔着很长的空腔在震颤。门板摸上去有轻微的余温。"
msgstr "A faint current of air trembles through the door gap, as if through a long hollow space. The door feels slightly warm to the touch."

msgctxt "FA_027"
msgid "门打不开？"
msgstr "The door won't open?"

msgctxt "FA_028"
msgid "我推过，很沉，内侧插着一根粗铁销。我是做音乐的，耳朵对回声很敏感，门外像是一处很大的空间。"
msgstr "I tried pushing it. It's very heavy, and a thick iron bolt is engaged on this side. I'm a musician, and I'm sensitive to echoes; the space beyond the door sounds vast."

msgctxt "FA_029"
msgid "能判断外面有没有人吗？"
msgstr "Can you tell if anyone's outside?"

msgctxt "FA_030"
msgid "看地上的痕迹，门底曾插过木楔。昨晚门外可能发生过异常，有人在内侧用木楔顶住大门，防止外面推开。"
msgstr "Look at the marks on the floor. A wooden wedge was once under the door. Something may have happened outside last night; someone inside may have wedged the door to keep it from being pushed open."

msgctxt "FA_031"
msgid "用木楔顶门防外？门是朝哪个方向开的？"
msgstr "A wedge to keep someone outside from pushing in? Which way does the door open?"

msgctxt "FA_032"
msgid "既然是防范外面，门自然该向内挡。碰那根内销时通知我一声，我站远些。"
msgstr "If it was meant to keep someone outside, the door must open inward to hold them back. Tell me before you touch that inner bolt; I'll stand farther away."

msgctxt "FA_033"
msgid "好，我先勘验锁止结构。"
msgstr "All right. I'll examine the locking mechanism first."

msgctxt "FA_034"
msgid "门缝的气流很平稳，暂时没有别的异常杂音。你要检查门扇，我把位置让给你。"
msgstr "The air through the door gap is steady. I don't hear anything else unusual for now. I'll make room while you inspect the door."

msgctxt "FA_035"
msgid "牢房、御敌、暴动……直觉上的猜想已经被逐一排除。"
msgstr "Prison, defense, riot... One intuitive guess after another has been ruled out."

msgctxt "FA_036"
msgid "但铜口要求的是明确的因果，单凭否定错误无法通过考核。"
msgstr "But the brass tube wants a clear account of cause and effect. We can't pass by merely ruling out wrong answers."

msgctxt "FA_037"
msgid "闭上眼睛，在脑海中把所有器物与痕迹重新排布。云杉木楔、生铁内销、碱水湿布、废纸篓……"
msgstr "Close my eyes and rearrange every object and trace in my mind: the spruce wedge, the wrought-iron inner bolt, the damp cloth and lye water, the wastebasket..."

msgctxt "FA_038"
msgid "只要时序符合物理因果，昨夜发生过的动线就可能在思维沙盘中严密呈现。"
msgstr "If the sequence obeys physical cause and effect, the movements from last night may take shape in the mind's replay."

msgctxt "FA_039"
msgid "那个声音要我们自己判断这里的用途？铁格窗、编号和死闩摆在眼前；研习桌上的东西又像长期用过。我暂时不肯只凭其中一边下结论。"
msgstr "That voice wants us to judge this place's purpose ourselves? The barred windows, room numbers, and deadbolt are right here; yet the things on the study table look long used. For now, I won't conclude from just one side of the evidence."

msgctxt "FA_040"
msgid "你最在意哪一点？"
msgstr "What concerns you most?"

msgctxt "FA_041"
msgid "我们把找到的物件都带到长桌上，一件一件比对。"
msgstr "Let's bring everything we've found to the long table and compare it piece by piece."

msgctxt "FA_042"
msgid "听到了吧，口粮只有今天的分量。它所谓的“放逐”，就是把想不出答案的人当成弃卒抹掉记忆扔回去。我们得抓紧。"
msgstr "You heard it: the rations are only for today. Its ‘exile’ means wiping the memories of anyone who can't find the answer and sending them back like discarded pawns. We have to hurry."

msgctxt "FA_043"
msgid "我想先和大家核对眼前的事。谁检查过哪里，就说自己实际看到了什么。"
msgstr "I'd like to compare what we've found. Each of us should say what we actually saw."

msgctxt "FA_044"
msgid "声音冰冷得像齿轮咬合。但至少证实了门外有人在监管。昨夜门底到底发生过什么，必须用事实回答它。"
msgstr "That voice was as cold as meshing gears. At least it confirms someone is monitoring us from beyond the door. We must answer with facts about what happened under it last night."

msgctxt "FA_045"
msgid "你腰边的小木盒，方便让我看看吗？"
msgstr "May I take a look at the little wooden box at your waist?"

msgctxt "FA_046"
msgid "可以。小心底下的凸起，放桌上时容易磕到。"
msgstr "Of course. Mind the raised bit underneath; it catches when you set it on a table."

msgctxt "FA_047"
msgid "你去说明我们已经核对过的部分，我会在这里听着。"
msgstr "Tell it what we've checked. I'll be here listening."

msgctxt "FA_048"
msgid "把确定的和没确定的分开说。需要补查，我们再一起去。"
msgstr "Keep what we know separate from what we don't. If we need to check more, we'll go together."

msgctxt "FA_049"
msgid "我也会听着。有遗漏，我们可以接着补充。"
msgstr "I'll listen too. We can add anything we've missed."

msgctxt "FA_050"
msgid "各位已经醒来。我在传声回路的另一端。"
msgstr "You have all awakened. I am at the other end of the speaking circuit."

msgctxt "FA_051"
msgid "想要开启通往主楼的大门，请向我阐明两项事实：这处空间经历过怎样的使用痕迹？门前的器物昨夜经历过何种因果？"
msgstr "To open the main doors to the central building, explain two facts to me: what use has this space seen, and what chain of events did the objects by the door undergo last night?"

msgctxt "FA_052"
msgid "契约仅接纳严密的物证与因果。你们可以调查、相互核对，无法确定的部分可如实保留，但不得凭空编造。"
msgstr "The covenant accepts only sound physical evidence and causal reasoning. You may investigate and compare notes. State what remains uncertain honestly; do not make anything up."

msgctxt "FA_053"
msgid "不愿继续探索者，可申请退场。契约允许送返，条件是洗去关于此地的全部记忆，由各人自愿决定。时限截至今日落日。"
msgstr "Anyone unwilling to continue may request to leave. The covenant permits your return, on the condition that all memories of this place are erased. The choice is each person's own. The deadline is sunset today."

msgctxt "FA_054"
msgid "我在听取真实之声。"
msgstr "I am listening for a true voice."

msgctxt "FA_055"
msgid "有人在听吗？"
msgstr "Is anyone listening?"

msgctxt "FA_056"
msgid "听得见。你们可以通过这只拉柄和我交谈。"
msgstr "I can hear you. Hold this lever to speak with me."

msgctxt "FA_057"
msgid "你是谁？这里在哪里？"
msgstr "Who are you? Where are we?"

msgctxt "FA_058"
msgid "我的名字受契约束缚，现不予宣读。你们所在的区域由我按约代管；它的名称和用途，须由你们依据眼前的痕迹陈述。"
msgstr "My name is bound by the covenant and cannot be spoken at present. I oversee this area under its terms. You must state its name and purpose based on the traces before you."

msgctxt "FA_059"
msgid "这里原本是什么地方？"
msgstr "What was this place originally?"

msgctxt "FA_060"
msgid "你可以提出自己的解释。但请说清楚，它依据哪些东西，还有哪些地方不能确定。"
msgstr "You may offer your own explanation. Just make clear what supports it and what remains uncertain."

msgctxt "FA_061"
msgid "昨夜大门外发生了什么？"
msgstr "What happened outside the main door last night?"

msgctxt "FA_062"
msgid "气流已平，烟尘已落。契约禁止我向未解开第一道试炼之人叙述昨夜的变故。请自行由物理残留中探寻。"
msgstr "The air has settled and the smoke has cleared. The covenant forbids me from describing last night's incident to anyone who has yet to solve the first trial. Find the answer in the physical traces."

msgctxt "FA_063"
msgid "如果今天内无法得出结论呢？"
msgstr "What if we can't reach a conclusion today?"

msgctxt "FA_064"
msgid "契约将判定你们不具备在此处探求真知的资格。日光落尽之时，供给停止，放逐程序即刻执行，全员抹除记忆送回原籍。"
msgstr "The covenant will judge that you are unfit to seek the truth here. At sunset, provisions will cease and exile will begin at once: everyone's memory will be erased, and all will be sent back to their home of origin."

msgctxt "FA_065"
msgid "提交论证"
msgstr "Submit deduction"

msgctxt "FA_066"
msgid "放弃探索"
msgstr "Abandon exploration"

msgctxt "FA_067"
msgid "松开拉柄"
msgstr "Release the lever"

msgctxt "FA_068"
msgid "它的回答受制于严格的规则。先收集足够的现场证据。"
msgstr "Its answers are bound by strict rules. First, gather enough evidence from the scene."

msgctxt "FA_069"
msgid "我们把手头的线索摊在桌上。从编号、窄窗、定额口粮来看，我倾向于这里是一处封闭式的收容或拘禁牢房。"
msgstr "Let's lay out the clues we have. The room numbers, narrow windows, and fixed rations make me think this is a closed detention facility or prison."

msgctxt "FA_070"
msgid "我有不同看法。门底留有木楔和灰迹，我认为昨夜外面发生过骚乱，有人在门内塞入木楔顶门御敌。"
msgstr "I see it differently. There's a wedge and soot beneath the door. I think there was a disturbance outside last night, and someone inside wedged the door to defend against it."

msgctxt "FA_071"
msgid "不过它为什么被包进纸里，还得解释。"
msgstr "But we still need to explain why it was wrapped in paper."

msgctxt "FA_072"
msgid "别忘了洗盆里的黑灰和带有挤压凹槽的木楔。有没有可能是有人企图用木楔撬门越狱，最后被门外的人用横闩锁死并镇压了？"
msgstr "Don't forget the black soot in the basin and the compression groove in the wedge. Could someone have tried to pry the door open and escape, only to be barred in from outside and crushed in a crackdown?"

msgctxt "FA_073"
msgid "我想到的是撑住门防外面的人，可门向哪边开，得一起核对。"
msgstr "I imagined bracing the door against someone outside, but we should check which way it opens."

msgctxt "FA_074"
msgid "那就先看器物能不能照我们说的那样工作。"
msgstr "Then let's first see whether the objects can actually work the way we suggest."

msgctxt "FA_075"
msgid "同意。也把我们没看见、只是猜的部分留下来。"
msgstr "Agreed. And let's keep track of what we're only guessing, too."

msgctxt "FA_076"
msgid "三种说法都有各自直观的诱因。但器物的物理特性必须完全符合推论。"
msgstr "Each of the three accounts has an intuitive motive. But the physical properties of the objects must fully support the conclusion."

msgctxt "FA_077"
msgid "我们逐项核验，看看现场留下的实物到底支持哪一种。"
msgstr "Let's check them one by one and see which account the objects at the scene actually support."

msgctxt "FA_078"
msgid "看看抽屉里层层垫入、磨损泛白的旧衬纸，再看研习桌上不同笔迹互相推敲划改的计算稿。"
msgstr "Look at the old lining papers layered in the drawer, worn pale from use. Then look at the calculations on the study table, with different hands challenging and revising one another's work."

msgctxt "FA_079"
msgid "我们出不去是昨夜之后的结果，但不能把眼下的困境反推为这里的原始用途。"
msgstr "Our inability to leave began after last night. We can't infer this place's original purpose from our present predicament."

msgctxt "FA_080"
msgid "（端详着桌上的计算纸，片刻后点头）……有道理。演算稿上的批注笔迹各异，确实属于长期的研讨。我把被困的现状误当作了房间的本质。"
msgstr "(He studies the calculations on the table, then nods.) ...You're right. The notes on these workings are in different hands; this really was long-term collaboration. I mistook our being trapped for the room's essential purpose."

msgctxt "FA_081"
msgid "隔离门的铰链位于主楼一侧，门洞四周嵌有厚重的花岗岩石砌止口。这扇门向生活翼方向根本拉不开，只能向外推。"
msgstr "The isolation door's hinges are on the main-building side, and its opening is surrounded by a heavy granite rebate. It cannot be pulled toward the Living Wing; it can only be pushed outward."

msgctxt "FA_082"
msgid "门顶设有滑轮配重系统，门一旦推开便会被重块自闭拉回。将木楔塞在门底，根本无法阻挡向内推撞——它的物理作用，是阻止门扇自行闭合。"
msgstr "A pulley counterweight above the door pulls it shut once opened. A wedge under the door could never stop an inward push; its physical purpose is to keep the door from closing by itself."

msgctxt "FA_083"
msgid "（抚弄着音叉，恍然自语）……门是向外推的？那么塞入木楔是为了保持缝隙……我确实忽略了石止口的朝向。"
msgstr "(He fingers the tuning fork, realizing.) ...The door pushes outward? Then the wedge was there to hold a gap open... I overlooked which way the stone rebate faces."

msgctxt "FA_084"
msgid "包裹木楔的旧练习纸，撕口与研习桌上的册子完全吻合。重点在痕迹：灰黑污迹全部集中在纸张接触木楔的内侧，外侧非常干净。"
msgstr "The torn edge of the old practice paper used to wrap the wedge matches the booklet on the study table exactly. More importantly, the gray-black marks are all on the inside where the paper touched the wedge; the outside is clean."

msgctxt "FA_085"
msgid "此外，门厅的地面被湿布用碱水有条理地擦拭过，铁止挡座被移到墙边。如果是撬门暴乱被暴力镇压，现场不可能留有如此从容的现场清理与物料包裹痕迹。"
msgstr "Also, the hall floor was methodically wiped with a damp cloth and lye water, and the iron doorstop was moved to the wall. A violent crackdown after an escape attempt would not leave such deliberate cleanup and careful wrapping of materials."

msgctxt "FA_086"
msgid "（看着洗盆边的碱水罐，若有所思）……用碱水擦地，特意用纸包好带灰的木楔。确实，这符合日常的收尾规矩，不是暴乱的做派。"
msgstr "(She looks thoughtfully at the lye-water jar by the basin.) ...They used lye water on the floor and carefully wrapped the sooty wedge in paper. That's routine cleanup, not the aftermath of a riot."

msgctxt "FA_087"
msgid "撑门观察、见到热烟后撤楔、门扇自闭后插上内销、再以纸包楔、移开止挡座、湿布擦地……至少这套时序能解释眼前的力学和痕迹。"
msgstr "Wedge the door open to look out, see hot smoke, remove the wedge, let the door close, engage the inner bolt, wrap the wedge in paper, move the stop, and wipe the floor... This sequence at least explains the mechanics and the traces."

msgctxt "FA_088"
msgid "这套解释有物证支撑。侦探，你去铜口前陈述吧。我们都在这里听着，如果那边的声音有异议，就一起核对。"
msgstr "The physical evidence supports this account. Detective, go present it to the brass tube. We'll all listen, and if the voice objects, we can check the evidence together."

msgctxt "FA_089"
msgid "门底的干净三角形和纸张内侧的灰痕，都有了说得通的来处。昨夜也许有人在阻隔烟尘；至于每一步是谁做的，还得谨慎。"
msgstr "The clean triangle under the door and the soot on the inside of the paper both make sense now. Perhaps someone was keeping smoke out last night; we should still be cautious about who did each step."

msgctxt "FA_090"
msgid "你说明了目前被困，却还没说明房间原来的用途。“临时牢房”需要更多根据。"
msgstr "You've explained why you are trapped now, but not the rooms' original purpose. A makeshift cell needs more support."

msgctxt "FA_091"
msgid "你提出的顶门动作与门的开向不合。请重新说明木楔怎样受力。"
msgstr "Your proposed bracing action doesn't fit the way the door opens. Reconsider how force acts on the wedge."

msgctxt "FA_092"
msgid "木楔的受力还不能证明越狱和镇压。请解释灰迹和包纸的关系。"
msgstr "Pressure on the wedge alone doesn't prove an escape attempt and crackdown. Explain the relationship between the ash and wrapping."

msgctxt "FA_093"
msgid "外闩与内销需要分别从两侧操作。你的回答只交代了一侧。"
msgstr "The outer bar and inner bolt must be operated from opposite sides. Your answer only accounts for one side."

msgctxt "FA_094"
msgid "这个回答还有未核对的部分。你可以继续调查，再来说明。"
msgstr "Parts of that answer still need checking. You may investigate further and return."

msgctxt "FA_095"
msgid "精巧的审视。在不可知的时间断层前，你们恪守了理性的边界。"
msgstr "An exquisite examination. Faced with an unknowable fracture in time, you held firmly to the boundary of reason."

msgctxt "FA_096"
msgid "你们说明了门曾被木楔撑开，沾灰后才被纸包起；内销与外闩位于门的两侧。旧物确实不足以断定你们早在此处居住。"
msgstr "You explained that the door was braced open with a wedge, wrapped only after gathering soot; and that the inner bolt and outer bar lie on opposite sides. Old items indeed cannot prove you had long lived here."

msgctxt "FA_097"
msgid "论证与物证相容。契约成立，主楼大门的阻隔已经解除。"
msgstr "The reasoning holds with the physical evidence. The covenant stands; the barrier of the main building gate is removed."

msgctxt "FA_098"
msgid "严谨的推导。你们辨认出长期生活研习的旧迹，重构了撑门探视、烟尘入内、撤楔合门与纸内转印。"
msgstr "Rigorous deduction. You recognized old traces of long-term life and study, reconstructing the braced door inspection, soot entering, wedge removal, and transfer marks inside the paper."

msgctxt "FA_099"
msgid "生活翼的内销和主楼侧外闩并非一次单方操作。契约成立，生活翼的封锁即刻开放。"
msgstr "The inner bolt of the living wing and the outer bar of the main building were not a unilateral operation. The covenant stands; the seal of the living wing is opened."

msgctxt "FA_100"
msgid "我们离开。"
msgstr "We are leaving."

msgctxt "FA_101"
msgid "如你所愿。"
msgstr "As you wish."

msgctxt "FA_102"
msgid "那么，送我们回去吧。"
msgstr "Then, send us back."

msgctxt "FA_103"
msgid "刚才没顾上介绍，我是机械工程师。你也听到了那个声音吧？"
msgstr "We didn't get to introduce ourselves. I'm a mechanical engineer. You heard that voice too?"

msgctxt "FA_104"
msgid "我是厨师，刚才一直在备餐间。现在我们得一起弄清处境。"
msgstr "I'm a chef. I was in the pantry. Now we need to work out our situation together."

msgctxt "FA_105"
msgid "我是音乐家，刚才在门边听动静。你和传声口说的话，我也听见了。"
msgstr "I'm a musician. I was listening by the door. I heard what you said through the speaking tube, too."

msgctxt "FA_106"
msgid "拉柄旁刻着一行字：按住接通，松手断开。"
msgstr "A line beside the lever reads: hold to connect, release to disconnect."

msgctxt "FA_124"
msgid "如果选择回去，它说我们会忘掉这里。你们怎么想？"
msgstr "It says we'll forget this place if we go home. What do you think?"

msgctxt "FA_125"
msgid "抹除记忆？我还会用这些工具，但不知道自己在这里做过什么。我不答应像一件损坏的工具一样被洗去心智送走。我拒绝签字。"
msgstr "Erase our memories? I would still know how to use these tools, but not what I did here. I won't let them wash my mind away and send me off like a broken tool. I refuse to sign."

msgctxt "FA_126"
msgid "看看储粮柜吧，它给的口粮精确到克，说明它根本不打算做慈善。抹除记忆的代价我们谁也无法预料，我不赞成退场。"
msgstr "Look at the cupboard: the rations are weighed to the gram. It clearly isn't doing charity. None of us can know what memory erasure would cost; I don't support leaving."

msgctxt "FA_127"
msgid "门缝后的风声我还没弄清缘由。如果在此刻选择遗忘，以后每一次拉琴我都会为今天的退缩而痛苦。我选择留下。"
msgstr "I still don't know what caused the wind beyond the door. If I choose to forget now, every time I play my instrument I'll regret backing down today. I'm staying."

msgctxt "FA_128"
msgid "（冷漠的金属共振）一人犹豫，三人拒绝。契约规定退场需四人全票一致。松开拉柄吧，退场申请未获达成。"
msgstr "(A cold metallic resonance.) One hesitates; three refuse. The covenant requires unanimous consent from all four to leave. Release the handle. The request to leave has not been approved."

msgctxt "FA_129"
msgid "确认共同离开"
msgstr "Confirm that we all wish to leave"

msgctxt "FA_130"
msgid "先留下继续调查"
msgstr "Stay and continue investigating"

msgctxt "FA_131"
msgid "侦探，你用什么根据说明这里不是收容牢房？"
msgstr "Detective, what evidence do you have that this isn't a detention facility?"

msgctxt "FA_132"
msgid "抽屉内的新旧补纸"
msgstr "Old and new repair paper in the drawer"

msgctxt "FA_133"
msgid "反复使用的研习材料"
msgstr "Repeatedly used study materials"

msgctxt "FA_134"
msgid "门上的编号"
msgstr "Numbers on the doors"

msgctxt "FA_135"
msgid "编号正是收容规制的典型特征，单凭这个否定不了我。"
msgstr "Room numbers are a classic feature of detention regulations. That alone doesn't disprove my point."

msgctxt "FA_136"
msgid "先继续查看"
msgstr "Keep looking for now"

msgctxt "FA_137"
msgid "如果木楔不是用来顶门防范外面推门的，构造上有何矛盾？"
msgstr "If the wedge wasn't meant to stop someone outside from pushing the door in, what about the construction contradicts that idea?"

msgctxt "FA_138"
msgid "铰链、石止口和自闭配重"
msgstr "The hinges, stone stop, and closing counterweight"

msgctxt "FA_139"
msgid "洗盆里的灰垢"
msgstr "Ashy residue in the basin"

msgctxt "FA_140"
msgid "灰垢只说明有人清洗过烟尘，说明不了木楔的受力方向。"
msgstr "The soot only shows that someone cleaned smoke residue. It doesn't tell us which way the wedge was loaded."

msgctxt "FA_141"
msgid "先继续查看"
msgstr "Keep looking for now"

msgctxt "FA_142"
msgid "那木楔背面的深凹槽和废纸篓里的黑灰又该作何解释？越狱被镇压的假设哪里不合？"
msgstr "What about the deep groove on the back of the wedge and the black soot in the wastebasket? What doesn't fit the theory that an escape attempt was suppressed?"

msgctxt "FA_143"
msgid "包纸撕口与接触面的灰迹"
msgstr "The wrapper's torn edge and ash on its contact surface"

msgctxt "FA_144"
msgid "备好的口粮"
msgstr "Prepared rations"

msgctxt "FA_145"
msgid "口粮只能说明目前没有断粮，解释不了木楔上的受力痕迹。"
msgstr "The rations only show that we aren't short of food right now. They don't explain the pressure marks on the wedge."

msgctxt "FA_146"
msgid "先继续查看"
msgstr "Keep looking for now"

msgctxt "FA_002_1"
msgid "窗外是无法看透的白雾。门外有走动声……我需要出去确认眼下的状况。"
msgstr "Impenetrable white fog outside. I hear footsteps beyond the door... I need to go out and find out what's happening."

msgctxt "FA_050_0"
msgid "（铜管内传来一阵沉闷的金属回音，随后是一个冰冷、平稳、没有任何情感起伏的非人声线）"
msgstr "(A dull metallic resonance travels through the brass tube, followed by a cold, steady, utterly emotionless inhuman voice.)"

msgctxt "FA_050_1"
msgid "按照立约者的规定，生活翼今日的供给已经配齐。在此周期内，此处没有迫近的生理危险。"
msgstr "Under the covenant-makers' rules, today's provisions for the Living Wing have been supplied. During this cycle, there is no imminent threat to your physical well-being here."

msgctxt "FA_078_1"
msgid "如果是临时牢房，不仅无法解释这些长期的、自发式的学术研习痕迹，更无法解释门内侧为什么安装着可由我们自主操作的重型铁销。"
msgstr "A temporary prison explains neither the long-term, self-directed signs of academic study nor the heavy inner bolt that we can operate ourselves."

msgctxt "FA_082_1"
msgid "昨夜有人把门撑开了一条缝，是为了向外观察，而不是为了顶门防守。"
msgstr "Someone wedged the door open a crack last night to look outside, not to defend against an attack."

msgctxt "FA_085_1"
msgid "这些痕迹更像是一次察觉外部异常后，主动撤楔合门并清洁现场的处置。"
msgstr "These traces fit someone noticing something unusual outside, removing the wedge, closing the door, and cleaning up afterward."

msgctxt "FA_130_1"
msgid "明白了，我们继续调查。"
msgstr "Understood. We'll keep investigating."
